sequenceDiagram
    participant vLLM as vLLM Engine<br/>(GPU Node)
    participant CE as LMCache Engine
    participant SM as StorageManager
    participant L1 as LocalCPUBackend<br/>(L1 DRAM)
    participant RB as RawBlockL2Adapter<br/>(io_uring / O_DIRECT)
    participant K as Kernel NVMe-oF<br/>(TCP or RDMA)
    participant JBOF as NVMe JBOF<br/>(dumb storage)
    participant GPU as GPU Connector<br/>(DMA to HBM)

    Note over vLLM,JBOF: === RETRIEVE (Cache Lookup) ===

    vLLM->>CE: retrieve(tokens)
    CE->>CE: TokenDatabase: hash tokens → chunk keys (BLAKE3)
    CE->>SM: batched_contains(keys)

    SM->>L1: batched_contains(keys)

    alt L1 HIT (page in DRAM)
        L1-->>SM: hit_chunks = N
        SM-->>CE: block_mapping: {LocalCPUBackend: keys}
        CE->>L1: get(keys)
        L1-->>CE: MemoryObj (pinned DRAM buffer)
        CE->>GPU: load → DMA to GPU HBM
        GPU-->>vLLM: KV in HBM, resume inference
    else L1 MISS → check L2
        L1-->>SM: hit_chunks = 0
        SM->>RB: submit_lookup_and_lock_task(keys)
        RB->>RB: metadata scan (header read from device)

        alt L2 HIT (page on JBOF)
            RB-->>SM: bitmap (hits found)
            SM-->>CE: block_mapping: {RawBlock: keys}
            CE->>RB: submit_load_task(keys, dst_buffers)
            RB->>K: io_uring submit (O_DIRECT read, 256KB)
            K->>JBOF: NVMe Read Command (over TCP/RDMA)
            JBOF-->>K: NVMe Read Response (256KB)
            K-->>RB: completion → data in registered DRAM
            RB-->>CE: load complete (bitmap)
            CE->>L1: promote to L1 (optional)
            CE->>GPU: load → DMA to GPU HBM
            GPU-->>vLLM: KV in HBM, resume inference
        else L2 MISS (not cached anywhere)
            RB-->>SM: bitmap (no hits)
            SM-->>CE: total_hit_chunks = 0
            CE-->>vLLM: miss mask (recompute these tokens)
            Note over vLLM: vLLM recomputes KV via forward pass
        end
    end

    Note over vLLM,JBOF: === STORE (After KV Computation) ===

    vLLM->>CE: store(tokens, kv_tensors)
    CE->>GPU: GPU HBM → DMA to host DRAM
    CE->>CE: hash tokens → chunk keys
    CE->>SM: put(keys, memory_objs)
    SM->>L1: put(keys, data) → pinned in DRAM (L1)

    Note over SM,RB: Async background flush to L2
    SM->>RB: submit_store_task(keys, data)
    RB->>K: io_uring submit (O_DIRECT write, 256KB)
    K->>JBOF: NVMe Write Command (over TCP/RDMA)
    JBOF-->>K: NVMe Write Completion
    K-->>RB: completion
    RB-->>SM: store complete
